{"root":"kak","ipa":"/kak/","core":"哥哥或姐姐的称呼，源自 kakak 的缩写，常用于对年长者或陌生人的亲切称呼。","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/kak/","zh":"哥哥或姐姐，对年长者的尊称","phrases":[{"t":"kakak kelas","zh":"学长或学姐"},{"t":"kakak beradik","zh":"兄弟姐妹"},{"t":"kakak ipar","zh":"姐夫、妹夫、嫂子或弟媳"}],"examples":[{"t":"Kak, boleh saya minta tolong?","zh":"哥哥/姐姐，我可以请你帮个忙吗？"},{"t":"Dia adalah kakak saya yang paling tua.","zh":"他是我最大的哥哥。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"kakak","ipa":"/ka.kak/","zh":"哥哥或姐姐（完整形式）","phrase":{"t":"kakak kandung","zh":"亲哥哥或亲姐姐"},"example":{"t":"Kakak saya bekerja di Jakarta.","zh":"我的哥哥在雅加达工作。"}},{"w":"berkakak","ipa":"/bər.ka.kak/","zh":"有哥哥或姐姐","phrase":{"t":"sudah berkakak","zh":"已经有哥哥姐姐了"},"example":{"t":"Dia sudah berkakak dua orang.","zh":"他有两个哥哥姐姐。"}},{"w":"kakakan","ipa":"/ka.ka.kan/","zh":"把某人当作哥哥或姐姐对待","phrase":{"t":"mengakakakan orang","zh":"认某人为兄姐"},"example":{"t":"Dia mengakakakan saya sejak kami bertemu.","zh":"自从我们见面以来，他就把我当作姐姐对待。"}}],"derSlugs":["kak","kakak","berkakak","kakakan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:29:09.954Z","src":"base"}